    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2022_0287","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Xochitl Lindqvist talks about why the canvas must stay blank. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</Description>
